# Auto-detect text files and normalize line endings to LF on commit
* text=auto

# LICENSE must keep its exact bytes (CRLF): the closed-source nt_helper.node
# validates the project-root LICENSE against a SHA-256 baked into the binary.
# Any EOL normalization changes the hash and trips the "组件已损坏或被篡改"
# guard. `-text` disables all line-ending conversion so it round-trips byte-
# for-byte on every platform.
/LICENSE -text

# Source code
*.ts text eol=lf
*.tsx text eol=lf
*.js text eol=lf
*.jsx text eol=lf
# ESM / CJS 脚本（scripts/、apps/web/scripts/ 等）：Biome 要求 LF，不写进来就会
# 落到上面的 `* text=auto`，在 core.autocrlf=true 的 Windows 上检出成 CRLF，
# 于是 format:check 只在 Windows 上红。
*.mjs text eol=lf
*.cjs text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.css text eol=lf
*.html text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
*.yaml text eol=lf
*.yml text eol=lf
*.toml text eol=lf

# Native / binary
*.node binary
*.so binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.dll binary
*.exe binary
